        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Monkey love banana,  how many can you feed?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bananaganza is a minimalist, casual arcade game where the only thing that matters is <i>bananas</i>. Forget the corporate grind for a while and focus on something that truly matters: collecting delicious banana slices.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Warning, it is more challenging that you might think! Are you ready for the banana beatdown?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3776630/extras/357443708f9389fee645a76206cc6667.poster.avif?t=1765259661\" width=600 height=166 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3776630/extras/357443708f9389fee645a76206cc6667.webm?t=1765259661\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3776630/extras/357443708f9389fee645a76206cc6667.mp4?t=1765259661\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Peel. Slice. Collect. Repeat.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Bananaganza, your ultimate mission is simple: collect as many banana slices as possible. But beware, not all bananas are created equal, and the rotten ones could ruin your fruity fun.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Here’s what you’ll be doing in Bananaganza:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🍌 Peel bananas. <br>🍌 Slice them into perfect pieces.<br>🍌 Catch the flying banana slices before they escape.<br>🍌 Dodge the rotten bananas.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3776630/extras/48efaa79aef23ed4de5101f980408482.poster.avif?t=1765259661\" width=600 height=166 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3776630/extras/48efaa79aef23ed4de5101f980408482.webm?t=1765259661\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3776630/extras/48efaa79aef23ed4de5101f980408482.mp4?t=1765259661\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bananaganza is lovingly hand-crafted (AI-free) by a solo indie developer whose top life goals are creating fun but small games. Every banana in this game was made with the hope of brightening your day.</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Monkey love banana,  how many can you feed?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bananaganza is a minimalist, casual arcade game where the only thing that matters is <i>bananas</i>. Forget the corporate grind for a while and focus on something that truly matters: collecting delicious banana slices.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Warning, it is more challenging that you might think! Are you ready for the banana beatdown?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3776630/extras/357443708f9389fee645a76206cc6667.poster.avif?t=1765259661\" width=600 height=166 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3776630/extras/357443708f9389fee645a76206cc6667.webm?t=1765259661\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3776630/extras/357443708f9389fee645a76206cc6667.mp4?t=1765259661\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Peel. Slice. Collect. Repeat.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Bananaganza, your ultimate mission is simple: collect as many banana slices as possible. But beware, not all bananas are created equal, and the rotten ones could ruin your fruity fun.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Here’s what you’ll be doing in Bananaganza:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🍌 Peel bananas. <br>🍌 Slice them into perfect pieces.<br>🍌 Catch the flying banana slices before they escape.<br>🍌 Dodge the rotten bananas.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3776630/extras/48efaa79aef23ed4de5101f980408482.poster.avif?t=1765259661\" width=600 height=166 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3776630/extras/48efaa79aef23ed4de5101f980408482.webm?t=1765259661\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3776630/extras/48efaa79aef23ed4de5101f980408482.mp4?t=1765259661\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bananaganza is lovingly hand-crafted (AI-free) by a solo indie developer whose top life goals are creating fun but small games. Every banana in this game was made with the hope of brightening your day.</p>",
